  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Award-Winning!</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/five-facts-about-lufthansa-allegris-that-will-surprise-you/lh_app_allegris_illustration3_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Illustration of a group of cranes flying in a V formation in a clear sky; medals hang around the neck of the first bird"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Great design gets noticed, and Lufthansa Allegris has impressed not only travelers, but also international design experts. The cabin concept has already received three prestigious awards: the German Design Award Gold, the International Design Award Gold, and the Red Dot Award for Product Design.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Teamwork</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/five-facts-about-lufthansa-allegris-that-will-surprise-you/lh_app_allegris_illustration4_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Illustration of a group of people carrying a relaxed-looking person"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A new travel experience does not happen overnight – countless experts from design, engineering, and crew training have spent years bringing Lufthansa Allegris to life. The first flight was perfectly timed for the occasion: the first Allegris Airbus took off on May 1, 2024 – Labor Day – from Munich, heading to Vancouver.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "(all illustrations © Sylvia Neuner)",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
